{
  "name": "03 - Stripe Dispute Visa CE 3.0 Lint & EU VAT VIES Guard (RevClamp)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stripe Dispute Visa CE 3.0 & EU VAT VIES Compliance Guard\n\n**1. Instant Zero-Key Test (Works Out-of-the-Box with Zero Credentials):**\nClick **Test workflow** right now. All 3 parallel branches (`Visa CE 3.0 120d-365d & 18k Char Lint`, `EU VAT VIES Consultation Proof`, and `RevClamp Hiring Watchlist` in `demoMode: true`) execute live against `https://revclamp.com` without requiring any API key or Slack credential.\n\n**2. Production Stripe / B2B Order Webhook Setup:**\n- Provision a workspace key (`rg_live_YOUR_WORKSPACE_KEY`) at `https://revclamp.com`.\n- On `Seed Dispute & Order Context`, set `demo` to `false` and paste your Finance / Dispute Slack Incoming Webhook URL (`https://hooks.slack.com/services/<TEAM_ID>/<BOT_ID>/<WEBHOOK_KEY>`) into `slackWebhookUrl`.\n- Add header `Authorization: Bearer rg_live_YOUR_WORKSPACE_KEY` on both HTTP Request nodes, and on `RevClamp Hiring Watchlist` connect your `revClampApi` credential and switch `operation` to `listBoards` (or `demoMode: false` on `previewDiff`).",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1030003-0003-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Quickstart & Finance Triage Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1030003-0003-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Test Sample Dispute & VAT Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "revclamp-stripe-ce3-vies-guard",
